window.products.push({"id":440061,"name":"Chefman 2.5 Liter/2.6 Quart Air Fryer with Digital Display Adjustable Temperature Control for The Perfect Result in Frying a Variety of Foods, BPA Fre","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PxtIWR-KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Chefman Air Fryer with Digital Display Adjustable Temperature Control for the Perfect Result in Frying a Variety of Foods, Cool-to-Touch Exterior and 2.5L Fryer Basket Capacity, Black - RJ38-P1 Gone are the days when meals could either be healthy or delicious.  The futuristic rapid air technology of the Chefman 2.5-liter Air Fryer means you can finally make fried foods that taste amazing but won’t clog your arteries. This versatile machine can make any delectable dish you’d normally make in a deep fryer, with little or even no oil, and a whole lot more.  The removable dishwasher safe 2.5-liter basket makes portions large enough for everyone to have seconds – which you can now have guilt free! A healthy living recipe booklet is included, so the only question is, what delectable dish will you make first?  You can cook home-made chips, cheese sticks, chicken nuggets, chicken fillet, drumsticks, steak, chicken chops, hamburgers, fish fingers, cupcakes, and much more with an ease and convenience of the rapid air technology provided by Chefman. COOKING TIPS • Smaller ingredients usually require a slightly shorter cooking time than larger ingredients.  • A larger quantity of ingredients only requires a slightly longer cooking time, a smaller quantity of ingredients only requires a slightly shorter cooking time. This is a benefit of this type of cooking.  • Shaking smaller ingredients halfway through the cooking time optimizes the end result and can help prevent unevenly cooking.  • Add some oil to fresh potatoes for a crispy result. Fry your ingredients in the Air Fryer within a few minutes of adding the oil.  • Snacks that can be prepared in an oven can also be prepared in the Air Fryer.  • The optimal amount for preparing crispy fries is 500 grams.  • Use pre-made dough to prepare filled snacks quickly and easily. The pre-made dough also requires a shorter cooking time than home-made dough.  • Place a Baking Tin or Oven Dish in the Basket if you want to bake a cake or quiche or if you want to fry fragile ingredients or filled ingredients.  • You can also use the Air Fryer to reheat ingredients. To reheat ingredients, set the temperature to 320F for up to 10 minutes.  • DO NOT use the reheat 320F setting to defrost ingredients as it may not fully defrost them. FUN STARTER RECIPE: Buffalo Wing Roasted Cauliflower Prepare for a fiery appetizer that has 75% less fat than the traditional roasted cauliflower recipes. Roasted without bathing in oil and evenly coated with delicious buffalo wing sauce that ignites the palate and begs for more. Ingredients 1 ½ cups of cauliflower florets, cut into ½ inch thick  1 tablespoons of olive oil ¼ cup of prepared buffalo wing sauce Pinch of salt Pinch of cracked black pepper 2 tablespoons of blue cheese crumbles for garnish Directions 1. Pre-heat Air fryer to 390° 2. In a medium mixing bowl add cauliflower, oil, salt, pepper, and toss.  3. Place all the cauliflower into the basket and cook 5 to 6 minutes.  4. When the cauliflower is done, transfer them into a mixing bowl and pour buffalo wing sauce over the top. Toss to coat evenly.  5. Put cauliflower in a serving bowl and top with blue cheese crumbles.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81PxtIWR-KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chefman","source_asin":"B07QFYJT84","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-440061","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QFYJT84","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QFYJT84","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
