window.products.push({"id":440082,"name":"Weighted Blanket Twin Size 15 lbs for Adults (48\" x 72\", Grey) Cooling Breathable Heavy Blanket Microfiber Material with Nontoxic Glass Beads Soft Thi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DTCp11FjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cooling & Breathable Weighted Blanket: The surface of the weighted blanket is made of 100% polyester fabric and filled with nontoxic glass beads. It is gentle on the skin and will not irritate those with sensitivities. The inside of the weighted blanket includes 7 layers of super soft cotton compartments, which firmly keep the beads inside for the best breathability. This weighted blanket can provide a cooling sensation in the summer & a breathable warmth in the winter. Improve Your Quality Sleep: The weighted blanket provides gentle, comforting pressure that can help to reduce tossing and turning, making it easier to fall and stay asleep. It will provide you with comfort throughout the night thanks to the soft touch and glass beads with a specific function. It will give you a comfortable hugging feeling and a sweet dream night. This weighted blanket not only can be used at sleep, but also can be used while reading, relaxing, or meditating. Recommended weight: This premium weighted blanket is designed to weigh approximately 10% of your body weight in order to relax by simulating the feeling of being held or hugged. For example, a 150 lb adult would use a 15 lb weighted blanket. The blanket should be no longer in size than the top of your mattress and should not hang over the sides of your bed, which may make you think it is smaller. Please reference our chart to determine which blanket is right for you. Unique Design: The weighted blanket features 3.6\" x 3.7\" inches small diamond-shaped compartments. The structure is designed with double-reinforced stitching to prevent beads from shifting or leaking while you are sleeping, making the weighted blanket distribute the weight evenly and allowing the blanket to conform to your body. Our weight blanket features 8 corner loops that can be used to secure a duvet cover with corner ties. Easy Care & Cleaning: The weighted blankets is more suitable for hand washing or dry cleaning. Although our weighted blankets feature new sewing techniques to ensure the blankets won't thread, the fabric's dense stitching and durable threads prevent glass beads from leaking, we still don't recommend machine washing. In addition, we recommend that you pair with a duvet cover or weighted blanket cover in the appropriate size to protect your weighted blanket and reduce cleaning time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71DTCp11FjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHRUN","source_asin":"B0B4QWZCGD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-440082","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4QWZCGD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4QWZCGD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
