window.products.push({"id":440122,"name":"Handheld Vacuum Sealer, Cheweetty 3 In 1 Mini Bag Sealer Heat Seal with Cutter/Electric Ball Pump with Needle and Nozzle for Football Basketball Ballo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eteAX5RjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Multifunctional Life Tool】The bag sealer mini is made of high-quality ABS material, which makes it elegant and durable. With Upgraded 3-in-1 design, it can heat seal bags or cut open bags, work as an electric balls pump with needle and nozzle, and hendheld vacuum machine for food storage. This small and portable vacuum sealer will wonderfully meet your need of keeping freshness and taste of food or snacks. What a fancy kitchen gadget! 【Heat Sealer Function】Press the power button for 2 seconds, the power light shows white light and the heat sealing function is turned on. The ‘-’ side is a cutter, which can cut the plastic bags. The ‘+’ side is a heat sealer. Place the bags to be sealed in the middle and slide it along the edge at a constant speed for airtight sealing. Please remember to turn it off after use to avoid overheating. 【Vacuum Function】 On the basis of the bag seal heat sealing function, press the switch again（the power light turns into orange） to turn on the vacuum function. Cheweetty handheld vacuum machine is suitable for sous vide bags, vacuum storage bags, vacuum lunch box, preserve & marination vacuum containers, etc. In the package you will get 3 zipper vacuum bags and 3 bag clips. They will make it much more convenient and efficient for you to keep food fresh. 【Inflation Function】For our handheld vacuum pump, the inflation function are automatically turned on at the same time of vacuum function. On the basis of the heat sealing function, press the switch again（the power light turns into orange） to turn on the inflation function. Cheweetty inflator has prepared two types of inflatable nozzles for you to inflate balls, such as basketball, football, toy ball, balloon, etc. 【USB Rechargeable & Portable】With a compact design, 6.7* 1.85 inch, this mini bag sealer vacuum sealer is very small and portable. The hook makes it easy to be stored and hung on while usb rechargeable design lets it power saving and environmentally friendly. It will help you wherever and whenever store food or snacks and keep them fresh. Note: Remove the hook before use, and then buckle it on after use.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eteAX5RjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cheweetty","source_asin":"B0B8D4PYNY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-440122","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8D4PYNY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8D4PYNY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
