window.products.push({"id":440210,"name":"RUNNA 6 Piece Dining Table Set Kitchen Table Set Included a Rectangular Dining Table/4 X-Shaped Curved Backrest Upholstered Dining Chairs/Upholstered ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":799.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91jt7FDln9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"👍This 6-Piece dining room set includes 1 rectangular table, 4 wooden dining chairs and 1 fabulous bench, this dining room set is suitable for occasions with many people-it can comfortably accommodate no less than 6 people. The rectangular table is made of high quality MDF veneer pine while the decorated wooden strips at the edges of both chairs and tabletop help to enhance the solid, traditional feel. This dining set frame and legs are crafted of premium quality rubber real wood to provide fantastic durability and stability, which are strong enough to support you and your family. Ideal for dinette, kitchen, and dining areas, this multi-functional dining set seats up to 6 people, perfect for families to enjoy meal times together. The smooth, waterproof table top can easily be cleaned with a simple wipe down, for hassle-free maintenance. All chairs and benches can be placed under the table when not in use, reducing floor space. This dining set can be used not only in home kitchen and dining room, but also fit in restaurant and other business place for its sophisticated look.  👍Dimensions & Weight Product Dimensions & Weight Table: 60\"L x 35.4\"W x 30\"H, 65 LBS Chair: 17.3\"L x 19\"W x 37.8\"H Bench: 38.6\"L x 15.3\"W x 18.5\"H Chairs+Bench: 75 LBS Package Dimensions & Weight Table: 63\"L x 39\"W x 5\"H, 70.55 LBS Chair+bench: 41\"L x 23\"W x 20\"H, 80.47 LBS Seat Dimensions: 17.3\"L x 17.3\"W Weight Capacity Table: 400 LBS Chair: 400 LBS/piece Bench: 400 LBS  👍Specifications Product Name: Dining Room Set of 6 Material Tabletop—MDF veneer Legs—rubber wood Frame—MDF Chairtop—burlap Front chair legs and frame—rubber wood Back chair legs—plywood Thickness Tabletop: 18 mm Upholstered Chair: Yes Finish: Distressed finish Color: Gray+n/Espresso+n/Natural Cherry+n Assembly Required: Yes Additional Tools Required: All tools included Package Number: 2 👍Care & Maintance 1. Care should be taken when placing hot items directly on the table. Use a trivet or surface pad when serving heated dishes. 2. Liquids should be immediately blotted with a damp cloth. Do not use surface cleaners that could remove the finish. 3. Hardware may loosen over time; periodically check to make sure all connections are tight. 4. Blot spills immediately with a clean, colorfast towel. Spot clean with a damp cloth or sponge, gently blotting to remove excess water, then air dry. For stains that can't be removed as such, professional cleaning is advised. We recommend periodically fluffing cushions and vacuuming crevices. To prevent fading, keep fabric out of direct sunlight.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91jt7FDln9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RUNNA","source_asin":"B0BMQ9LKSK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-440210","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BMQ9LKSK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BMQ9LKSK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
