window.products.push({"id":440289,"name":"HUILI Premium Stainless Steel Salt and Pepper Grinder Set (Pack of 2 Mills) with spoon and Clean Brush - Adjustable Ceramic Pepper Mill & Salt Mill –T","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51IPwYDteSL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"COOK LIKE PROFESSIONAL CHEF! Great gift for your friend and family. FEATURES: ☆ 304 Stainless Steel：We manufacture all our salt and pepper mills out of heavy duty, thick and premium food grade stainless steel and glass, making them long lasting and rust and corrosion resistant. Includes, non-corrosive ceramic, fully adjustable grinder with reinforced grinder housing. ☆ Adjustable Ceramic Coarseness: It can be adjusted for fine to coarse grind with 5 grinder settings. Handles Seasoning of 6mm or Less. For example: pepper, sea salt, exotic spices and fine herbs, etc. ☆ Elegant Stand：Display your seasonings mills in style with the convenient stand. Easy to be carried around from kitchen to living room. ☆ FREE Silicone Funnel: You’re not just getting the grinders, you’re also getting a FREE Bamboo Spoon and Clean Brush,that makes you fill spices in the bottle without any miss. SIZE: 7.5\" tall , 2.5\" in diameter, 6OZ. NOTE: 1 Store the grinder set in a cool and dry place. 2 Please handle this product with care to avoid damage to the Glass body. AFTER-SALE GUARANTEE: We can offer 100% risk free and satisfaction service.If you have any problem,just feel free to contact us. You will receive a courteous and prompt solution within 24 hours. PACKAGE LIST: Grinder Set *2 Packing Box *1 Bamboo Spoon*1 Clean Brush*1","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51IPwYDteSL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lihui","source_asin":"B07R2DM3S2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-440289","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07R2DM3S2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07R2DM3S2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
