window.products.push({"id":440294,"name":"MAKAYLA Dehumidifiers,Big Dehumidifiers, 56oz(1650ml) 5500 Cubic Feet(550sq ft) Dehumidifier with 7 Colors LED Light and Auto Shut-off, Super Quiet Co","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51rNwMUlGAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Efficient for Large Space】: MAKAYLA dehumidifier is equipped with advanced semiconductor dehumidification technology. It can remove 600ml-650ml (20-22 oz) of water from the air at 86°F and 80% RH,suitable for 100 to 550 square feet space. 360-degree airflow design can make the air fresher. The large-capacity 1650 ml (56 oz) water tank can continuously dehumidify within 24 hours. 【Two Working Modes】: The dehumidifier has Day Mode and Sleep Mode. In day mode, it will run in high-speed dehumidification with rapid reduction of humidity, and the noise level is less than 39 dB. In sleep mode, it will work in low-speed mute mode to ensure that the dehumidifier runs quietly, so that you can enjoy a sound sleep, and the noise level is less than 30 dB. 【7 Colors LED Light】: MAKAYLA Dehumidifier is designed with 7 colors LED Light for a romantic atmosphere. You can keep the color changing or lock your favorite color. 【Auto Shut-off】: The dehumidifier and LED light will automatically shut off when the water tank is full to avoid overflowing. In addition, the red light will flash to warn. 【Easy to Carry】: Our Dehumidifiers have less than 4lb weight and small size (6.9*6.9*12.6inch). You can easily move it to every corner in your house without taking up any space. You can put it in your kitchen, bathroom, bedroom, garage, RV and closet in 100 sq ft - 550 sq ft. 【Energy-Saving】: The electric dehumidifier is effective and energy-saving, with a power of only 60W/hour, which means that it only consumes 1.15kW of electricity after 17 hours of operation. Compared with traditional large compressors or desiccant dehumidifiers, it is environmentally friendly and cheaper. 【Worry-free Customer Service】: We offer 1-Year Quality Promise and 7 x 24h customer service. Please feel free to contact us if you have any questions with this product.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51rNwMUlGAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Makayla","source_asin":"B0B4FN4NDT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-440294","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4FN4NDT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4FN4NDT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
