window.products.push({"id":440406,"name":"AOFEITE Large Laundry Basket Hamper with Wheels 115L Rolling Collapsible Fabric 3 Section Clothes Organizer Sorter with Leather Handle Card Pocket Bre","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":42.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OR6NS8gAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Large & Collapsible】: The collapsible laundry basket is 21.65x13.78x23.62 inches, has a 115L large capacity, and can hold 33 pounds of laundry for holding more families dirty clothes or kids' toys. It can be folded into a small volume of 21.65x13.78x2.76 inches. Big enough to hold many loads and small enough to fit perfectly in the bathroom. 【3 Sections and 6 Sort Cards】: The hampers for laundry has 3 sections, 3 clear plastic bags on the side, and come with 6 sorting cards that you can use to mark the sections, great for separating clothes by colors or by fabrics and pre-sort your laundry for convenience and saving time. 【Waterproof & Dust-proof】: Eco-friendly 600D Oxford cloth, lined with waterproof coating, strong breathability, thick and durable fabric. The drawstring mesh cover helps you stack and transport your laundry without falling, keeping the contents of the clothes hamper clean and tidy. 【Strong & Lightweight】: The laundry basket with wheels and handle adopts detachable and easy-to-assemble pillars, to make the rolling hamper stand upright. It's sturdy, lightweight, and portable enough to hold enough clothes for easy transport to a laundromat or laundry room. 【Rolling & Removable Handles】: The four wheels at the bottom of the foldable laundry basket are made of PU material, besides being very tough, it can also prevent scratching the floor. They also lock into place, keeping the basket still until you want it to roll again. Also comes with a detachable long leather handle that stretches to a longer size if a side is removed, allowing you to pull the laundry sorter more easily.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OR6NS8gAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AOFEITE","source_asin":"B0BCJT7FJ2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-440406","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCJT7FJ2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCJT7FJ2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
