window.products.push({"id":440670,"name":"Digital Meat Thermometer for Cooking: Oven Probe Turkey Food Instant Read Temperature Thermometers - Grill Leave in Safe Deep Frying Smoker Fryer Oil ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.77,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719R1UMSoGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Fast and accurate reading: the digital thermometer for cooking reads in 2-3 seconds, measuring accuracy: +/-1℃ at -20℃ to 150℃ (-4°F-302°F), over +-2℃ at other ranges. temperature measuring range -50℃-300℃ (-58°F-572°F), display resolution: 0.1℃. No guessing, no more worrying about overdone food, enjoy the cooking! Wide range of applications: The instant read meat thermometer is not only used in cooking, grilling, frying, candy making and baking, but also perfect for making steak, roast turkey, barbecue, fish, pork and more. The digital food thermometer solves the trouble of microwave applications with a long wired 4.6-inch detachable probe that can be placed in and out of the microwave oven. Safety & Convenience: The probe thermometer has a large backlight screen for clear readings in dim or bright places. There are two stainless steel 304 probes that can be easily inserted into food or liquid to get the temperature reading without worrying about the risk of burning your hands. Waterproof & Storage: The grilling thermometer is waterproof up to IP67 rating and can be cleaned with water. There is a beer bottle opener can also be used as a hook, the meat probe thermometer has a magnet inside, can be hung up or attached to the Refrigerator. Lifetime worry-free service: The digital cooking thermometer has an automatic alarm function that automatically alerts you when the temperature reaches the temperature you have set. If you have any questions or problems about the food thermometer for cooking, please feel free to contact us and we will get back to you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/719R1UMSoGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ELEOPUS","source_asin":"B09CYMD62H","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-440670","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CYMD62H","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CYMD62H","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
