window.products.push({"id":440700,"name":"CGEAR Sand-Free Towel, Super-Soft, Absorbent, and Quick-Dry (Ocean Stripe)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816vJ7asnJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Your beach experience has officially changed. Welcome to your new, sand-free life. CGEAR’s Sand-Free Beach Towel combines our proprietary technology with soft, absorbent material to provide the ultimate in leisure tech. Our patented system is a precisely engineered weave that allows sand, dirt, and dust to fall through the fabric. Because the layers are staggered, sand can only go one way (down), not back up. And because this towel is made with 100% high-quality polyester, it’s super soft to the touch. Most towels are either quick drying or absorbent. Higher thread counts feel softer but are also woven more tightly together, which means they retain water for longer periods of time. By using our proprietary multiple-layer system, the Sand-Free Towel has double the air-surface exposure, making it twice as quick drying. Are you sick of having sand scratch, rub, and exfoliate your skin every time you dry off? Tired of having to shake out your towel in the wind, or track sand back into your house or car? CGEAR’s Sand Free Towel solves all these problems. Its large profile makes it a perfect beach blanket and it packs down to a small enough size to make it super portable. The towel also features a hanging loop so you can easily stow away the towel when you are not using it. CGEAR’s patented sand-free technology was originally designed for military use, and though the application of our products has changed, our dedication to quality has not. With CGEAR, you get what you pay for, and we expect you’ll come back for more. In addition to our Sand-Free Beach Towel, we offer a range of products including chairs, sandals, mats, and more. Start enjoying your sand-free life today.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816vJ7asnJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CGEAR","source_asin":"B0B4MX3QDH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-440700","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4MX3QDH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4MX3QDH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
