window.products.push({"id":440705,"name":"Enesco Peanuts by Jim Shore Snoopy with Woodstocks and a Stocking Figurine, 7 Inch, Multicolor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":48.82,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712SQJaBl+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Peanuts by Jim Shore showcases the Peanuts gang as interpreted and designed by one of America's leading folk artists. Jim Shore's collectible figurines celebrate nostalgic Peanuts moments as memorable gifts. Snoopy, Charlie Brown's lovable dog is bringing gifts and stuffing stockings of Woodstocks this year. Bring the love of Peanuts by Jim Shore home for the holidays this year. About Us: Enesco is committed to BRING JOY EVERY DAY. The premier global destination for high-quality giftware, and home décor, our prestigious family of brands includes: Department 56 Village, Things Remembered, Foundations, Jim Shore Heartwood Creek, Disney Traditions by Jim Shore, Disney Showcase Collection, Disney by Britto, Designs by Lolita, Our Name is Mud, and many more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712SQJaBl+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Enesco","source_asin":"B09M6HQ3ZS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-440705","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09M6HQ3ZS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09M6HQ3ZS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
