window.products.push({"id":440818,"name":"Mermaid Balloons Garland Kit, Mermaid Balloon Arch Set,Mermaid Decorations for Birthday Party with Colorful Rain Curtain, Mermaid Balloons Confetti Pu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71600wGVuyL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","description":"🎉 WELCOME TO MERMAID OCEAN PARTY - Purple Mermaid Themed Party Kit for a fairytale party event for your girls. Mermaid balloons, pink rain curtains, shell balloons, confetti balloons, green, purple, blue, lavender, white latex balloons, all of which are beautiful and heart-warming. Use this mermaid set to decorate your summer party and no doubt it will be a very successful choice and it will amaze everyone who attends the event. Happy birthday to your princess. 🧜‍♀️ MERMAID BALLOON DECORATION PRODUCTS INCLUDE - 1 * Mermaid balloon；2 * Shell balloons；1 * 2m x 1m Pink rain curtain； 10 * 12 inch Confetti balloons； 10 * 12 inch Metallic green balloons；10 * 12 inch Metallic purple balloons； 10 * 10 inch Green balloons；10 * 10 inch Dark purple balloons； 10 * 10 inch Light purple balloons； 15 * 5 inch Clear balloons； 1 balloon Garland strip (16ft)； 1 Balloon glue dots (100 Glue Dots) and 1 Balloon knotting tool. 🎈HIGH QUALITY - The items in the new mermaid balloons decorative set is based on a mermaid and is matched with balloons of various colors to perfectly restore the dream scene of a mermaid's life.The mermaid shell balloon is made of high-quality aluminum foil, which is not pungent and not easy to burst; the latex balloon is made of high-quality latex, which is elastic and durable. Each balloon is rigorously tested and hand-selected to ensure child safety. 👪 EASY TO DECORATE AND USE - All balloons in the Mermaid Balloons set support air and helium filling, please inflate all balloons by 80%-90% to avoid balloon rupture due to overfilling. Balloon arch strips, glue dots and balloon chains are provided in the set. You can choose to scatter the balloons on walls, windows, ceilings, etc. wherever you want to decorate, or you can make balloons into balloon garlands with the provided balloon chain tool. ✨ENJOY THE FUN OF DIY - Rich and diverse product categories, just the right number of products, Allows you to have enough product to decorate an entire party at once, but without getting tired from too many products. This mermaid balloon set is widely used for mermaid birthday party supplies, baby showers, bridal showers, weddings, ocean theme parties, undersea parties. You can create and dress up a beautiful mermaid underwater world with your kids, it will be a paragraph wonderful family time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71600wGVuyL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JTKLION","source_asin":"B09W4Q84B9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-440818","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09W4Q84B9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09W4Q84B9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
