window.products.push({"id":440988,"name":"Home Maison Newbury Linen Striped Window Curtain 2 Panel Drape Set, 40 x 96, Beige","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61613UKk3oL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"Company history founded over twenty years ago by the Cohen Brothers buying fabrics from the U.S. Mills, producing sheet sets, window, and shower curtains. They have a 75 year family history in textiles, going back to their grandfather, who had his own Spinning and weaving mill overseas.He taught his grandsons all about fabrics and techniques which they still use until today. Fifteen years ago, as the U.S. Mills started shutting down one by one, the Cohen Brothers were one of the first who had the foresight to move their factory overseas. They created partnerships and joint ventures worldwide, which continuously keeps expanding till today. They continue with there fashion forward thinking giving them and their factories a leading edge in the market place. Duck river Inc has been praised and recognized by many in the industry for their quality, foresight, and on time deliveries.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61613UKk3oL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home Maison","source_asin":"B07BLKRM7J","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-440988","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BLKRM7J","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BLKRM7J","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":440989,"name":"HIG 2800 Supreme Collection Extra Soft Queen 4 Piece Embroidered Sheets Set, Dark Gray - Luxury Bed Sheets Set with Deep Pocket Wrinkle Free Comfortab","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ESFGk4AzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HIG Scroll 4 Piece Bed Sheet Set These sheets set are made of high strength yarns, 100% brushed microfiber, with a high density in 100 GSM, It has the lustrous feel and silky-smooth touch like Egyptian cotton that brings you a wonderful dream and peaceful sleep.  Wrinkle free and color fade resistant, nice embroidery on pillowcases and flat sheet make it more elegant and graceful. HIGH PERFORMANCE QUALITY: Made of high quality Imported Brushed Microfiber, breathable & comfortable. stronger and more durable than cotton, with the strongest stitching to prevent tears Deep-pocket,  fully elasticized fitted sheet for mattresses up to 16 Inches deep. HEALTHY ENVIRONMENT: Yarns and ventilated weave of the sheet set make it comfortable and breathable.  You can breathe easy and wake up feeling refreshed instead of congested,  and those with sensitive skin or conditions like eczema rest in a healing environment instead of being further irritated at night. VIBRANT, FADE-RESISTANT COLORS: This sheet set is made to look as good as it feels. Its color fastness is unbelievably strong and lasting,  and even after year of regular use it will still looks as vibrant as the first time you get it. EASY, ENEGRY-EFFICIENT CARE: The Sheet Set are fade, stain and shrink resistant that make you can safely clean it.  Machine wash in cold water with similar colors. Warm iron when necessary. Tumble dry low. Do not bleach.  These beautiful pillowcases are skin friendly, soft and made to last long. 100% SATISFACTION GUARANTEE: We are super confident in the quality and comfort of our product that we offer a 100% satisfaction guarantee!  Try our products and you will love it. WE ARE THE FACTORY, NO INTERMEDIATETRADING CHANNELS, THAT IS WHY WE CAN SAVE MONEY AND GIVE OUR CUSTOMERS BEST PRICE EVER!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ESFGk4AzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HIG","source_asin":"B07VN47BZQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-440989","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07VN47BZQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07VN47BZQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
